          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "I'm looking for things to do in Cambridge. Are there any nightclubs?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "Ballare is a nightclub in the centre of town. Would you like more details?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "How much does it cost to get in, and which area is it in?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "The entrance fee is £5, and Ballare is in the centre of town. Is there anything else I can help you with?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "No, that's it. Thanks! Goodbye."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "You're welcome. Have fun!"
